{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been two decades since the enemy first swept into the Solar System and attacked Earth.  Humanity's forces put up a desperate fight for survival and, at great cost, slowed the enemy advance to a stalemate.  Now, the heaviest fighting rages on continuously at the edges of the Solar System, far from the inner planets where a semblance of peace has returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is against this backdrop that Earth intelligence discovered the locations of the enemy's homeworld and other planets within its wide-ranging domain.  Hoping to force an enemy withdrawal and relieve pressure from Earth's defensive forces, the military formed a naval strike group to launch a surprise attack directly into their territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/9b358b767ac49451319db9ceedb8ce0c.avif?t=1755852787\" width=400 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As captain of a Unified Earth Forces starship, you are thrust into the heart of the counter-offensive, leading daring missions deep into enemy territory.  Your objective is to spearhead the assault, establish vital footholds, and pave the way for our Marine landing forces.\u00a0 Fly your ship to hostile planets, engage in thrilling ship-to-ship combat, and land on the surface to build fortified spaceports. Place a variety of emplacements to secure the area against waves of enemies.  Of course, you can always use your trusty assault rifle in a pinch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Planetary Fortifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically as you deploy barriers, turrets, gates, and barbed wire on the planet to safeguard the area against relentless waves of enemies.\u00a0 Or, if it's been a long day, maybe you can just build a wall of turrets.\u00a0 The enemy will get the message.\u00a0 Create a secure zone to allow our Marines to land safely.\u00a0 After reinforcements arrive and you've succeeded in your mission, you can get resupplied with unlimited materials to continue building in a<strong> sandbox mode</strong>.\u00a0 Keep coming back to the planet to work on the base and fight off enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/0e6ed5509361466d9c7d094242014761.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/0e6ed5509361466d9c7d094242014761.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/0e6ed5509361466d9c7d094242014761.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6ac97b9a58e7bcc9dfb4c5d9395c5af5.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6ac97b9a58e7bcc9dfb4c5d9395c5af5.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6ac97b9a58e7bcc9dfb4c5d9395c5af5.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Intense Space Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills as a starship captain as you evade hostile fire, strafe alien space stations, and escort ships during fleet battles.\u00a0 Blast incoming missiles with your ship's point-defense turret and strike hard with your railguns.\u00a0 Dominate the fight and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/978c86ca61aa86cf9586b053faefd039.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/978c86ca61aa86cf9586b053faefd039.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/978c86ca61aa86cf9586b053faefd039.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/77b9533c4a84813429937498fc9bd64b.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/77b9533c4a84813429937498fc9bd64b.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/77b9533c4a84813429937498fc9bd64b.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax and Enjoy Down Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortified Space offers more than just adrenaline-pumping combat.\u00a0 Take a break from the battlefield to walk around your ship, talk to your crew, and read the news articles that update after each mission.\u00a0 Gather materials through asteroid mining, hydroponic farming, and composting.\u00a0 You can even kick around a soccer ball or play a target-shooting arcade game.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/f7646a49affaabf0e28af150dc7cc634.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/f7646a49affaabf0e28af150dc7cc634.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/f7646a49affaabf0e28af150dc7cc634.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for shore leave?\u00a0 Fly to Earth and explore the civic and cultural institutions in humanity's capital.\u00a0 Don't forget to visit the Library of Earth to read about the Interplanetary War and other interesting topics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76d038162113e0639d8efc3347338dd8.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76d038162113e0639d8efc3347338dd8.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76d038162113e0639d8efc3347338dd8.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3c52e592e6cdbe81e65f043e2e835521.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3c52e592e6cdbe81e65f043e2e835521.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3c52e592e6cdbe81e65f043e2e835521.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightsail Game Studios</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks To:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Richard Wei, MVP (Most Valuable Playtester)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>JustJDR, Capsule Artist</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819710?t=1755852787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/0210ad226f900c40f6888a78890a8c506ca1627f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755852787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/63989c8af143c35fdc8ea7176caa5fe83df9f570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755852787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/63989c8af143c35fdc8ea7176caa5fe83df9f570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755852787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3887930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Current Development Status</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fortified Space Demo is now available! Thank you for the phenomenal level of interest and feedback you have provided so far.\u00a0 The demo will continue to receive regular updates, driven by player suggestions, and the full Early Access version will be released in late 2025.\u00a0 I hope you enjoy.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been two decades since the enemy first swept into the Solar System and attacked Earth.  Humanity's forces put up a desperate fight for survival and, at great cost, slowed the enemy advance to a stalemate.  Now, the heaviest fighting rages on continuously at the edges of the Solar System, far from the inner planets where a semblance of peace has returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is against this backdrop that Earth intelligence discovered the locations of the enemy's homeworld and other planets within its wide-ranging domain.  Hoping to force an enemy withdrawal and relieve pressure from Earth's defensive forces, the military formed a naval strike group to launch a surprise attack directly into their territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/9b358b767ac49451319db9ceedb8ce0c.avif?t=1755852787\" width=400 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As captain of a Unified Earth Forces starship, you are thrust into the heart of the counter-offensive, leading daring missions deep into enemy territory.  Your objective is to spearhead the assault, establish vital footholds, and pave the way for our Marine landing forces.\u00a0 Fly your ship to hostile planets, engage in thrilling ship-to-ship combat, and land on the surface to build fortified spaceports. Place a variety of emplacements to secure the area against waves of enemies.  Of course, you can always use your trusty assault rifle in a pinch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Planetary Fortifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically as you deploy barriers, turrets, gates, and barbed wire on the planet to safeguard the area against relentless waves of enemies.\u00a0 Or, if it's been a long day, maybe you can just build a wall of turrets.\u00a0 The enemy will get the message.\u00a0 Create a secure zone to allow our Marines to land safely.\u00a0 After reinforcements arrive and you've succeeded in your mission, you can get resupplied with unlimited materials to continue building in a<strong> sandbox mode</strong>.\u00a0 Keep coming back to the planet to work on the base and fight off enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/0e6ed5509361466d9c7d094242014761.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/0e6ed5509361466d9c7d094242014761.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/0e6ed5509361466d9c7d094242014761.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6ac97b9a58e7bcc9dfb4c5d9395c5af5.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6ac97b9a58e7bcc9dfb4c5d9395c5af5.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6ac97b9a58e7bcc9dfb4c5d9395c5af5.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Intense Space Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills as a starship captain as you evade hostile fire, strafe alien space stations, and escort ships during fleet battles.\u00a0 Blast incoming missiles with your ship's point-defense turret and strike hard with your railguns.\u00a0 Dominate the fight and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/978c86ca61aa86cf9586b053faefd039.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/978c86ca61aa86cf9586b053faefd039.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/978c86ca61aa86cf9586b053faefd039.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/77b9533c4a84813429937498fc9bd64b.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/77b9533c4a84813429937498fc9bd64b.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/77b9533c4a84813429937498fc9bd64b.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax and Enjoy Down Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortified Space offers more than just adrenaline-pumping combat.\u00a0 Take a break from the battlefield to walk around your ship, talk to your crew, and read the news articles that update after each mission.\u00a0 Gather materials through asteroid mining, hydroponic farming, and composting.\u00a0 You can even kick around a soccer ball or play a target-shooting arcade game.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/f7646a49affaabf0e28af150dc7cc634.poster.avif?t=1755852787\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/f7646a49affaabf0e28af150dc7cc634.webm?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/f7646a49affaabf0e28af150dc7cc634.mp4?t=1755852787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for shore leave?\u00a0 Fly to Earth and explore t